      "content": "i get the importance of social change, but aren't you saying that the actual skill or \"craft\" involved doesn't really matter as long as the message is there? it seems like we're basically saying that good art doesn't need to be beautiful anymore, it just needs to be loud. isn't that kind of a downgrade for the medium?",
